The value is 26.
The alphabet is "0123456789abcdef".
The reversed is empty text.
Repeat while value is more than 0.
The digit is value modulo 16.
The piece is the slice of alphabet from digit to digit plus 1.
Place piece into reversed.
Set value to value divided by 16.

The size is the number of characters in reversed.
If size is 0, Place "0" into reversed.
The last is the last position of reversed.
The result is empty text.
For every step from 0 to last.
The source is last minus step.
The piece is the slice of reversed from source to source plus 1.
Place piece into result.

Show result.
